{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "989f11cd-e77e-8345-b3d3-c7cb3c05968e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T11:15:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:13:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Luis. Frank Cardillo, I'm on Dean Avenue, 402 Dean, up in the Fifth Ward. Hang on, I'm typing some notes here, so if you hear clacking that's the laptop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:13:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear it. Sounds like a very productive typist."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:14:02-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two fingers. So, I got the tax bill, and my brother-in-law told me his came a week late one year, which I don't get, because the mail around here, I mean, they redid the route back when the old carrier retired, anyway. My question is, if I miss the date on an installment, what's the penalty for paying late?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:14:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's interest that builds on a late installment, charged from the due date. I can't quote you the exact figure off the top of my head, but it's on the back of your bill, and the longer it sits the more it grows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:14:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, interest from the due date. Got it. [pause] Second thing, I want to change my mailing address. I'm going to have the bills go to a different place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:14:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'll want to send that in writing to the tax office, with your name, the property address, and the new mailing address. You can email it or drop it off. I can put you through to the tax collector's line if you want to confirm the details."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:15:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, writing, fine. Last thing. I'd like to pay this installment before the weekend. But I'm not going to get down there before you close today. How do I pay once the office is shut? Is there a drop box, or can I do it online?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:15:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. There's a payment drop box at City Hall that's available when we're closed, and you can pay online through the city's website anytime. Check or money order in the box, with your bill stub."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:15:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Check in the box with the stub. Okay, and that's good by Friday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:15:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's in the box before the weekend, you're fine to go on. Online, same thing, just do it before midnight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:15:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's all I needed. Thanks, Luis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:15:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Frank. Keep typing."
    }
  ],
